# Git for Windows enables core.autocrlf by default, which rewrites LF to CRLF on
# checkout. This repository verifies its inputs by SHA-256, so such a rewrite
# makes a checked-out file disagree with data/glasgow-5m-sources.json and aborts
# `hydromind data rebuild` before anything is downloaded. Normalise text to LF in
# the repository and check it out unchanged on every platform.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Byte-exact and hash-locked in data/glasgow-5m-sources.json: never eligible for
# end-of-line conversion in either direction.
data/glasgow-dtm-edge-patch.csv -text
